OL,6,     FHenry Cole and Simon O'Brien
OL,7,     Fsearch for more items to fix up
OL,8,     Fand sell on, visiting a Norman
OL,9,     Fcastle, restoring a Fiat 500 and
OL,10,     Fmaking a table from part of
OL,11,     FSouthend pier.
OL,12,G0405 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,13,     FHenry Cole restores two quad bikes
OL,14,     Fand a stylish sun lounger, while
OL,15,     FSimon O'Brien rescues a holed
OL,16,     Fcanoe and turns an old oak beam
OL,17,     Finto a spice rack.
